The doorbell rings.
I open the door.
Neha and Amit are standing outside.
"Welcome!"
"Come in, come in," I say happily.
"Hi Maya, what a great smell is coming!" Neha says.
"Yes, I am very hungry," Amit says.
"First sit here," I tell them.
I point to my small dining table.
They both sit on the chairs.
I go into the kitchen.
First I take three plates.
Then I take three glasses.
After that, I fill a jug with water.
I put all the things on the table.
"Give me just two minutes," I tell them.
I bring the hot poha.
"Wow, the poha looks very nice!" Amit says.
"Thank you!"
"Come on, let's eat now," I say smiling.
